codex
The plate and glimmer handlers currently ignore `pos`. I also found local-coordinate hero dust, midpoint-based junction shimmers, and counters that increment only after audio plays. I’ll fix those while preserving the particle pools and ambient effects, and make `FX.unlock()` awaitable so the harness can check the resumed audio context.

